Metadata-Version: 1.1
Name: PyTimer
Version: 0.1
Summary: A module to control Interval Timer
Home-page: http://www.ip-arch.jp
Author: Naohiko Shimizu
Author-email: nshimizu@ip-arch.jp
License: MIT
Description: This package provides a class to control the POSIX timer on Unix like OS.
        It provides create, delete, settime, gettime functionalities which is corresponds to
        POSIX timer_create, timer_delete timer_settime, timer_gettime, respectively.
        
        I hope the code is useful enough but it may not suitable for time critical applications.
        
        
        Change Log
        ==========
        
        
        0.1
        ------
        - First version.  Imports some code from RPi.GPIO
        
